PARITY MAPPING (web → Apple platform tokens; no Tailwind ported)
  HeroStatus              → HealthRowStatus ; DOT_FOR_STATUS/TEXT_FOR_STATUS → tint:
                            green→statusSuccess · amber→statusWarning · red→statusDanger · zinc→textMuted · blue→statusInfo.
  to/external/onClick     → 4 initializers: <div>→init(status:icon:label:summary:) ·
                            <button onClick>→…action: · <Link to>→…destination:onNavigate: · <a target=_blank>→…externalURL:.
  (to || onClick) chevron → HealthRowProjection.showsChevron(interaction) ; "chevron.right" SF Symbol, textMuted.
  Lucide icon prop        → optional SF Symbol (systemName), textSecondary, Dynamic-Type scaled (@ScaledMetric).
  min-h-[44px]            → HealthRowShell .frame(minHeight: 44).
  hover:bg-white/[0.04]   → surfaceGlass (dark = white@0.04) filled on .onHover for interactive rows.
  aria-label `L — S`      → HealthRowAccessibility.rowLabel ; .accessibilityLabel + spoken status word as value;
                            interactive rows add .isButton (Link adds .isLink); static row uses children:.combine.
  i18n      : web label/summary are caller props (verbatim). Native-only chrome (states/freshness/VoiceOver words)
              resolves via P1/S10 HealthRowStrings — zero English literals in the view code.
  telemetry : view.opened surface="HealthRow" via HealthRowSurface.reportOpen (P1/S11), default OSLog sink.

